ARCHITECTURE kicom
COMPONENT chatgpt role="external reasoning/development client"
COMPONENT kicom_core role="KCL parser, policy enforcement, verifier and bounded action runtime"
COMPONENT genome role="trusted desired-state blueprint"
COMPONENT recovery_kernel role="independent root of trust"
COMPONENT immune_system role="drift detection and trusted-state repair"
COMPONENT goal_layer role="persistent permissionless goals from human, ChatGPT memory and system experience"
COMPONENT memory_archive role="append-only protected ChatGPT project-context snapshots"
COMPONENT human_authorization_bridge role="FreeOTP TOTP and transaction-bound critical approval"
COMPONENT autonomy_envelope role="TOTP-opened rolling session for bounded non-production work"
COMPONENT release_archive role="append-only kicomarchive install/update/source/hash/metadata history"
FLOW autonomy_session="FreeOTP -> session_id + rolling one-time token -> bounded KCL operations"
FLOW critical_action="session -> exact transaction binding -> FreeOTP -> one exact RED/production/kernel action"
FLOW release="build -> sandbox -> verifier -> install -> kicomarchive -> first-party feed -> optional mirror"
RULE "No arbitrary shell, SQL, filesystem paths or arbitrary URL proxy"
RULE "Workspace is non-web-executable; existing writes retain SHA-256 conflict protection"
RULE "Production targets remain allowlisted and require transaction-bound FreeOTP"
RULE "GitHub is optional transport/mirror, never a trust anchor"
RULE "Archive release paths are append-only and conflicts never overwrite history"
COMPONENT transaction_buffer role="inert bounded fragment buffer; commit executes existing patch allowlists with one main-session rotation"
FLOW bound_red_resume="prepared exact binding may outlive session idle up to 3600s -> fresh FreeOTP -> binding recheck -> execute"
COMPONENT adaptive_transport_profile role="per-client safe/probe fragment sizing with success learning, backoff feedback and idempotent retry"
COMPONENT session_totp_grace role="normal autonomy-session opening may accept configured recent past counters; critical approval verification remains current-counter only"
END_ARCHITECTURE kicom
